          <CodeBlock code={"export PATH=\"/opt/dogsbay-xml/bin:$PATH\"\ndogsbay-xml --version"} lang="bash" />
          <p>Add the <code>export</code> line to <code>~/.bashrc</code> or <code>~/.zshrc</code> to keep it.</p>
        </TabsContent>
        <TabsContent value="macOS">
          <CodeBlock code={"export PATH=\"/Applications/DogsBay-XML.app/Contents/MacOS:$PATH\"\ndogsbay-xml --version"} lang="bash" />
